{"key":"u13-apphycm-mcq-018-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"F₀L/2","working":"The work done by a position-dependent force along the direction of motion is given by the integral: W = ∫[0 to ∞] F(x) dx = ∫[0 to ∞] F₀L³ / (x + L)³ dx. Substituting u = x + L (with du = dx), the limits change from u = L to u → ∞. Thus, W = F₀L³ ∫[L to ∞] u⁻³ du = F₀L³ [-1 / (2u²)] from L to ∞ = F₀L³ (0 - (-1 / (2L²))) = F₀L³ / (2L²) = F₀L / 2.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":388,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":388,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":504,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":186,"reasoningTokens":318},"totalTokens":892,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":318,"promptTokenCount":388,"candidatesTokenCount":186,"totalTokenCount":892,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":388}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":186}]},"reasoningTokens":318,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3357,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"u13-apphycm-mcq-018-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"F₀L/2","working":"The work done by a position-dependent force is W = ∫ F(x) dx from x=0 to x→∞. Substitute F(x) = F₀L³/(x+L)³:\n\nW = F₀L³ ∫₀^∞ (x+L)⁻³ dx.\n\nLet u = x+L; then du = dx, and limits become u=L to u→∞:\n\nW = F₀L³ ∫_L^∞ u⁻³ du = F₀L³ [ -1/(2u²) ]_L^∞ = F₀L³ (0 + 1/(2L²)) = F₀L/2.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":448,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":64,"cacheReadTokens":384},"outputTokens":409,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":181,"reasoningTokens":228},"totalTokens":857,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":448,"completion_tokens":409,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":64,"total_tokens":857,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":228}},"reasoningTokens":228,"cachedInputTokens":384},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4297,"keyed_label":"B"}
