{"key":"u13-apphycm-mcq-025-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"D","final_answer":"20 m","working":"Using Newton's second law, m(dv/dt) = -bv. Since dv/dt = v(dv/dx), we have m v (dv/dx) = -bv, which simplifies to m dv = -b dx for v > 0. Integrating from v = v_0 to v = 0 gives m(0 - v_0) = -b x_total, so x_total = m*v_0 / b. Substituting m = 5.0 kg, v_0 = 8.0 m/s, and b = 2.0 kg/s yields x_total = (5.0 * 8.0) / 2.0 = 20 m.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":400,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":400,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":604,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":191,"reasoningTokens":413},"totalTokens":1004,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":413,"promptTokenCount":400,"candidatesTokenCount":191,"totalTokenCount":1004,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":400}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":191}]},"reasoningTokens":413,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4040,"keyed_label":"D"}
