{"key":"u13-apphycm-mcq-028-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"D","final_answer":"64 N in the +x direction","working":"The relationship between a conservative force and potential energy in one dimension is F(x) = -dU/dx. Given U(x) = 4.0 x^(-2), we differentiate with respect to x: dU/dx = -8.0 x^(-3). Thus, F(x) = -(-8.0 x^(-3)) = +8.0 / x^3. Evaluating at x = 0.50 m: F(0.50) = 8.0 / (0.50)^3 = 8.0 / 0.125 = +64 N. The positive sign indicates the force is in the +x direction.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":409,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":409,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":406,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":187,"reasoningTokens":219},"totalTokens":815,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":219,"promptTokenCount":409,"candidatesTokenCount":187,"totalTokenCount":815,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":409}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":187}]},"reasoningTokens":219,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3877,"keyed_label":"D"}
{"key":"u13-apphycm-mcq-028-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"D","final_answer":"64 N in the +x direction","working":"Force is F = -dU/dx. Given U(x) = 4.0/x² = 4.0 x⁻², dU/dx = 4.0(-2)x⁻³ = -8.0/x³. Thus F = 8.0/x³. At x = 0.50 m, F = 8.0/(0.50)³ = 8.0/0.125 = 64 N. Since dU/dx is negative, F is in the +x direction.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":455,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":71,"cacheReadTokens":384},"outputTokens":416,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":150,"reasoningTokens":266},"totalTokens":871,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":455,"completion_tokens":416,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":71,"total_tokens":871,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":266}},"reasoningTokens":266,"cachedInputTokens":384},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3931,"keyed_label":"D"}
